# Do not run dependency lifecycle scripts on install.
#
# Every recent npm supply-chain incident of consequence executed through a
# preinstall/postinstall/prepare hook, and a compromised package that cannot run
# code at install time is largely defanged. pnpm 10+ and bun already refuse
# these by default (the pnpm sites here carry an explicit onlyBuiltDependencies
# allowlist); npm still runs them, so these three repos were the fleet's only
# gap.
#
# Safe here because nothing in this repo needs a build script: no sharp, no
# native Tailwind oxide build -- Next, React and Tailwind v4 all ship prebuilt
# platform binaries as optionalDependencies. If a dependency ever genuinely
# needs one, allow that single package rather than removing this line.
ignore-scripts=true
